  m_text: "Goal: Get 3 noughts / crosses in a row\nTo place a nought / cross, you
    have to beat the wordle. Players alternate turns (starting with player 1), and
    if you fail to beat the wordle your turn ends immediately! \nUse a keyboard to
    type into the wordle, and the Tic-Tac-Toe squares will unlock. \n\nWordle Colours\nGreen
